# Exploring Variables in Memory with C

In this project, we will write high-level code that uses variables and examine how this works in memory.

---

## Step 1: Create the Source File

First, create a file in your root directory called `vars.c`.
Use the command:

```bash
nano vars.c
```

This opens the file for editing, allowing you to add your script.

